		<p>I'm Ashley Watson-Nolan, a Principal Engineer working at <a href="https://medium.com/justeattakeaway-tech">Just Eat Takeaway.com</a>.
		</p>
		<p>I love design systems, front-end coding, playing around with new technologies and the challenge of the
			ever changing world of web technology.</p>
		<p>I’m also a passionate Welshman – although I couldn't sound less Welsh if I tried.</p>
		<p>If you want to find out a bit more about me, <a title="A brief history of me"
				href="blog/a-brief-history-of-me">go ahead and take a look</a>, find me on <a
				href="http://www.twitter.com/WelshAsh_" rel="external">Twitter</a> or drop me an <a
				href="mailto:hello@ashleynolan.co.uk">email</a> – it'd be great to hear from you.</p>
